sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Customer->>Product: Review cart
    Product-->>Customer: Quantities, prices, subtotals and total
    Customer->>Product: Edit quantity or remove item
    alt Valid edit
    Product-->>Customer: Updated cart and total
    else Invalid quantity
    Product-->>Customer: Correction near affected item, no silent replacement
    end
    alt Cart empty
    Product-->>Customer: Empty-cart guidance, cannot place order
    end
